 ploads/event/Dec%2014_20260917193707559702.png
DESCRIPTION:The last N. AVL Democratic Precinct 4.1 Social of 2026. Cash b
 ar for NA and higher octane drinks\; snacks available at the bar. We plan 
 to take stock of where we are in 2026 and where we want to go as a group i
 n 2027 - political\, social\, action events . . . . Who should attend: All
  Democratic Precinct 4.1 folks\, plus any who would like to attend from th
 e N. AVL Cluster or any other group of like-minded citizens to gather for 
 celebration\, company\, and comfort in shared beliefs.
LOCATION:Ginger's Revenge\, 829 Riverside Dr #100\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1038197/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
