DESCRIPTION:Do you like to read? Do you want to build community? Do you wa
 nt to fight fascism? Join the Progressive Democrats of Buncombe for our re
 ading group\, meeting monthly on Mondays\, where we do all of this and hav
 e fun while doing it. This month\, we're not reading anything. Instead\, w
 e're asking you to use the time to help get out the vote for your candidat
 es of choice\, and then to join your fellow book club members for fun and 
 conversation after Election Day. Note that we will pick December's book a
LOCATION:White Labs Brewing\, 172 S Charlotte St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1068680/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
